    },
    {
      "text": "An item that prevents any low-level wild Pokémon\nfrom jumping out at you for a while. It lasts longer\nthan Repel.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "弱い　野生の　ポケモンが\nまったく　でて　こなくなる。\nむしよけスプレーより　長く　効く。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "弱小的野生宝可梦\n将完全不会出现。\n效果比除虫喷雾更持久。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Evita encuentros con Pokémon salvajes débiles durante\nmás tiempo que un Repelente normal.",
